      "statement": "Pi Agent Desktop uses an Electron three-process architecture: a Main process owning window/menu/tray/protocol/updates/browser/toolchains/reaper, an Agent Host utilityProcess running pi-coding-agent, and a sandboxed React Renderer; the application exposes no internal TCP service for UI or control plane.",
